{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-12-27 10:21:00', 'title': 'S&P CORELOGIC CASE-SHILLER INDEX CONTINUED TO DECLINE IN OCTOBER', 'text': 'NEW YORK , DEC. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P DOW JONES INDICES (S&P DJI) TODAY RELEASED THE LATEST RESULTS FOR THE S&P CORELOGIC CASE-SHILLER INDICES, THE LEADING MEASURE OF U.S. HOME PRICES. DATA RELEASED TODAY FOR OCTOBER 2022 SHOW THAT HOME PRICE GAINS DECLINED ACROSS THE UNITED STATES.'}